          "category": "class",
          "description": {
            "value": "<p><strong>Requirements</strong> You wield two melee weapons, one in each hand.</p>\n<hr />\n<p>You split your attacks. Make two melee @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.Strike]{Strikes}, one with each required weapon, each against a different foe. If the second Strike is made with a non-agile weapon, it takes a -2 penalty.</p>\n<p>Increase your multiple attack penalty only after attempting both Strikes.</p>"
          },
          "level": {
            "value": 8
          },
          "prerequisites": {
